  <section class="wrap fiche-body">
    <div>
      <h2>The vibe</h2>
      <p>Clinique Vétérinaire Tison, on boulevard Pasteur in Cavalaire-sur-Mer, is an option in town for your dog's care, alongside <a href="/en/fiche-veterinaire-jackowski">Cabinet Vétérinaire du Dr Jackowski</a>. It is easy to reach: its website mentions parking spaces and a two-wheeler spot in front of the clinic, which stands opposite the Camping de la Baie on boulevard Pasteur. In the waiting room, a sales area offers food, treats, toys, veterinary products and accessories; the clinic also has a small sunny courtyard where you can wait with your companion without stress, and which is used to run a puppy school.</p>

      <h2>What to know before you go</h2>
      <p>Consultations are by appointment, Monday to Friday from 8am to 12:30pm and then 2:30pm to 6:30pm; the clinic is closed on Saturday and Sunday. Outside these hours, it points to the emergency number 04 89 88 34 34: the UV Delta 83 clinic (Puget-sur-Argens), a structure dedicated to emergencies that is open only at night, on weekends and on public holidays. The Tison clinic therefore does not provide night or weekend cover itself.</p>
      <p>It explains that it only sees patients by appointment to avoid long, stressful waits for animals and to keep room for a life-threatening emergency; arriving on time also avoids unpleasant encounters between animals. Outside opening hours, the answering machine gives the details of the facility able to receive an emergency. The website also offers a partner online shop (Chronovet) with free delivery to the clinic, and the clinic selects its ranges of dog and cat food (Specific, Veterinary HPM).</p>
      <div class="callout">Coco's tip: save the emergency number (04 89 88 34 34) on your phone as soon as you arrive in Cavalaire, because the clinic is closed at weekends.</div>

      <h2>Nearby</h2>
      <p>The clinic is on boulevard Pasteur in Cavalaire-sur-Mer, in the Var; its website says to follow the "port" / "casino" signs when arriving from the Toulon - Le Lavandou road or from La Foux.</p>
